OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed for Christmas night
OL,4,Aout attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped a woman at the end of a
OL,7,FChristmas night out has been jailed for
OL,8,Ffour years and three months.
OL,10,FMalcolm Clark, 57, attacked his victim
OL,11,Fafter a pub crawl in Middlesbrough,
OL,12,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,14,FJudge Francis Laird KC said it was
OL,15,Fclear the offence "had and continues to
OL,16,Fhave a significant effect" on the
OL,17,Fwoman's daily life.
OL,19,FClark, from Sunderland, who had denied
OL,20,Frape but was found guilty by jurors,
OL,21,Fwill also have to sign the sex
OL,22,Foffenders register indefinitely.
